# Browser
# Bot2's Cuombajj Witches: Bot2 chooses the first target, and Bot1's page is asked to choose the second, "any target of
# an opponent's choice", for an ability it does not control (CR 115.1). The page's prompt names the ability, Bot1 clicks
# Bot2's box, and each player is dealt 1 damage.
[Bot1 Deck]
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Cuombajj Witches
Mox Jet
Gleemox
Swamp x20
[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Cuombajj Witches.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Cuombajj Witches.Activate
Bot2.Target(Bot1)
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Target for Cuombajj Witches
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 19
? Bot2.Life = 19
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot2.Battlefield.Cuombajj Witches.Tapped = true
